:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：开预约的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2023-08-23 16:32<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2F7JgFSNjK0UNMOuXJKPRwIQ\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/7JgFSNjK0UNMOuXJKPRwIQ</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息139.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c7/72xafugk93306ku2kwk2w8puptbju7z.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"120\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"120\" />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p>各位团长好！<br />\n小场记今天给大家带来的是<br />\n<font color=\"brown\"><b>罗迪尼亚法皇国</b></font>的介绍<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息159.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8a/s4tzkpwm03oylk76e0uw1h2dgi1lcp4.png/150px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF159.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"140\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8a/s4tzkpwm03oylk76e0uw1h2dgi1lcp4.png/225px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF159.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8a/s4tzkpwm03oylk76e0uw1h2dgi1lcp4.png/300px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF159.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"460\" data-file-height=\"428\" /><img alt=\"官方消息160.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e1/a7vq7wb84pph4k1n5zfz0sueqlv2kyz.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"100\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n</p>\n<table style=\"width:90%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>在<font color=\"brown\"><b>【神圣辉煌】</b></font>的庇护下，法皇国的财富与权势也在进行着扩张，如同<font color=\"brown\"><b>潘多拉魔盒</b></font>一般，内部腐化与管辖地区的动荡等问题也随之袭来。为了重现往日辉煌，<font color=\"brown\"><b>第二次光辉之战</b></font>顺应而生......\n<p><br /><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><img alt=\"官方消息178.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/85/739y04kzxl28gljufriv6k5svbzxxp3.png/500px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF178.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"500\" height=\"819\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/85/739y04kzxl28gljufriv6k5svbzxxp3.png/750px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF178.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/85/739y04kzxl28gljufriv6k5svbzxxp3.png/1000px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF178.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1769\" /><img alt=\"官方消息162.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d6/svw1kgm80z16l73m4cyr5qbzzppqu7h.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"100\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n庇护之光的统治地位<font color=\"brown\"><b>岌岌可危</b></font><br />\n而一次<font color=\"brown\"><b>地震</b></font>的发生<br />\n则让法皇国从<font color=\"brown\"><b>地下深处</b></font>探得了发展新机遇<br />\n......<br />\n各位团长<font color=\"brown\"><b>敬请期待</b></font>\n<br /><br />\n<font color=\"brown\"><b>【铃兰记事簿】法皇国·第三期</b></font>\n</p>\n</center>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163728\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 97/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2392/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 274/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   33.060      1 -total\n 52.49%   17.354      1 模板:文章戳\n 47.16%   15.592      1 模板:面包屑\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:3087-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022163727 and revision id 